= Ajay U. Mandlekar -- Projects

== Open-Source Software

~~~
{}{img_left}{assets/robomimic/thumbnail.png}{robomimic}{225}{150}{}
*robomimic* \n\n

I led the development of [https://arise-initiative.github.io/robomimic-web/ robomimic], a framework for robot learning from demonstrations.
~~~

~~~
{}{img_left}{assets/robosuite/thumbnail.png}{robosuite}{225}{150}{}
*robosuite* \n\n

I helped develop and currently maintain [http://robosuite.ai/ robosuite], a robot simulation benchmark powered by the [http://mujoco.org/ MuJoCo physics engine].
~~~

